    "text": "By KBUN Sports ,\n8 hours ago #2 Bemidji State women’s soccer’s return to the NCAA Division II Central Region tournament ended in a 1-0 overtime loss to #7 Central Missouri in a first round match on Friday at BSU’s Chet Anderson Stadium. Izzy Joyce scored the winner for the Jennies in the 98th... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
